{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lujpidwysc2u", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "Sport NZ’s 2023 Active NZ survey gives us valuable insight into the many New Zealanders who rely on public access to the outdoors. A quarter of all adults went tramping that year, and one-third of adults wanted to try tramping in 2024. 🚶🌄", "content_hash": "357314e91f801bb308241adc9c31099457367d0c4e50b64254a4e0cf06570e87", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lujpidwysc2u", "cid": "bafyreigfkon6mszo2zfl7omyfqh5jaekp6ctir2d2vtzl6mjpp43ny7df4", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-07-22T04:52:39.477Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-07/3lujpidwysc2u.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lujpidwysc2u", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3ltzvtv6v5c2e", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "We are seeking Outdoor Access Champion Award nominations for people and groups who champion public access to the outdoors. 🏆\nThey recognise those who have made significant and lasting contributions to public access to the outdoors in Aotearoa. \nMore details: www.herengaanuku.govt.nz/our-work/new...", "content_hash": "676f05e9e2f05df3f0b276ff0447b6a715f2d9320bf7ac43ae3876fb623bceac", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3ltzvtv6v5c2e", "cid": "bafyreiheehh7fmavyotufapmyzreywrxx5lvbxycxibrqbxd57eoqts7au", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "Josephine Elworthy, 2022 Outdoor Access Champion, shows a bush trail in Clevedon to a group of five other people. Josephine (wearing a green cowboy hat) and her Clevedon Trails Steering Group colleagues have worked toward a trail network in Clevedon for over a decade.", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreien4mn6qjq4jbacbekg4wrgktv2tdfrl5gkqk3jcz3wmpgkh7sq3i", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreien4mn6qjq4jbacbekg4wrgktv2tdfrl5gkqk3jcz3wmpgkh7sq3i"}], "original_created_at": "2025-07-15T22:03:53.041Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-07/3ltzvtv6v5c2e.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3ltzvtv6v5c2e", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3ltissiaaqk2w", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "There is a lot of public access in NZ that is only visible on our public access maps, WAMS. Explore public access in NZ: www.herengaanuku.govt.nz/types-of-access\nIf you think you are being accidentally blocked from walking on publicly accessible land, contact one of our regional field advisors.", "content_hash": "377975b1c26e33cf93ab6ccd667264a067358f515135cb7a5c2e8edf5a1e9efa", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3ltissiaaqk2w", "cid": "bafyreiaku3qm3bfvgco37gwltqpfowlvb4bwxvlihopfl7uq4ldrxeaaxy", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "Cartoon of a tramper who is trying to cross farmland, but she is blocked by an angry bull standing on the other side of the farm gate. The caption reads \"The bull hadn't checked WAMS to know he's blocking an unformed legal road.\"", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreifetm5iqiwe2fesbgm7fg5l4vpmzxbpembuztgnckvqua4h6soe5m", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreifetm5iqiwe2fesbgm7fg5l4vpmzxbpembuztgnckvqua4h6soe5m"}], "original_created_at": "2025-07-09T02:54:09.371Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-07/3ltissiaaqk2w.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3ltissiaaqk2w", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lt3wixf46k2x", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "If you’ve got a special corner of NZ that you want to share, we can help you set up a public walkway. Here are some of the benefits of creating legal access on your land: www.herengaanuku.govt.nz/advice/landh...", "content_hash": "03e329e6b8459b90e85e6a615e651bc997c392ba79a90faf04386176f458eda8", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lt3wixf46k2x", "cid": "bafyreihwkzdssyqumkvo4myy6wzuwrwb7kdtohsl4ozgpqbl3pbyev5nse", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "A cartoon farmer is inviting someone to walk on a path across his land. In the background are mountains, trees and sheep. The text on the image reads \"walk this way\".  The background to the image is partially drawn with AI.", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreic6e5irxffmn37gv4wf2mtlmom7tj3uw5arhzweagia43ocxlefuy", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreic6e5irxffmn37gv4wf2mtlmom7tj3uw5arhzweagia43ocxlefuy"}], "original_created_at": "2025-07-03T23:55:48.086Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-07/3lt3wixf46k2x.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lt3wixf46k2x", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lswhee5yjc2i", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "It would be a shame if New Zealanders lost access to the outdoors because it had been locked off and commercialised for hunting tourism businesses. We wrote to @thepress.co.nz today, saying we need to balance tourism dollars with #publicaccess to the outdoors. 🦌", "content_hash": "7fdbd23714874b5ff6f2d3a729f9bc8f62202c7b8d3094bbe48de015ebefe569", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lswhee5yjc2i", "cid": "bafyreieuh4m3hfzglk52pu2cxgwbm3yq62hqqpfz4uuu3xmdcamgtamqbu", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreicgs2bqgiegi5czrhnzhnu6py5ihnctbzlbxhfiec5eycdv2xsp6m", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreicgs2bqgiegi5czrhnzhnu6py5ihnctbzlbxhfiec5eycdv2xsp6m"}], "original_created_at": "2025-07-01T19:41:28.894Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-07/3lswhee5yjc2i.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lswhee5yjc2i", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rebeccamatthews.bsky.social/post/3luqi2wrffk2n", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:07+00:00", "content": "Geordie Rogers is one of the best councillors I have worked with. He’s smart, hard working, strategic and a great support to his women colleagues including me. Please help him get re-elected by joining me at his movie fundraiser, or just flicking him a donation. facebook.com/events/s/the...", "content_hash": "64cd69ccfb503c60e820d29400d4e0bd9fb714c6abe3d382c63f0a65f1270d3e", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:nzmxipots5hdjhm7j3embfj2/app.bsky.feed.post/3luqi2wrffk2n", "cid": "bafyreiakfgy6j5j6rhokm3mlnlkqlikgzzreo6k2ozjxh3onyxqznmub7m", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-07-24T21:28:31.424Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-07/3luqi2wrffk2n.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3luqi2wrffk2n", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz/post/3luogkbunhs2s", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:07+00:00", "content": "People do not think about politics every day of the year. So many people update their electoral details when they’re reminded - which in many cases is when they go to vote!", "content_hash": "8dc6bfa885acaef418fbbeb324ec4a086a74625131f951073572ce9bdfbfe791", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:6tjnjuyqrgmnfihpfdlww4m3/app.bsky.feed.post/3luogkbunhs2s", "cid": "bafyreif4efl3skmlcw2ify2w4ytjlvx3mdg5orcfzmhzopf23vm5ukq7ri", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-07-24T01:55:57.378Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-07/3luogkbunhs2s.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3luogkbunhs2s", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz/post/3luogk7w2k22s", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:07+00:00", "content": "Stopping people from being able to update their electoral details on the spot just further disenfranchises voters who move often (renters, seasonal workers etc.). A bad move that’ll only harm people’s democratic right to vote www.thepost.co.nz/politics/360...", "content_hash": "c5a08449b9d1faa409c0d99e3cf74b844854930a15d655028d3613db97f13c1d", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:6tjnjuyqrgmnfihpfdlww4m3/app.bsky.feed.post/3luogk7w2k22s", "cid": "bafyreigdhn555avqxlku5wrhxyw7fpe354fxheud56dvfksk3w4j72am4q", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-07-24T01:55:57.377Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-07/3luogk7w2k22s.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3luogk7w2k22s", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz/post/3luo6xpqlis2r", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:07+00:00", "content": "We're about to lock in a cinema size for my movie fundraiser, so if you want to come along you've only got a couple of days to secure your tickets! And if you don't want to come you can always pay forward a ticket for a volunteer! geordierogers.co.nz/movie", "content_hash": "8d5592d6d6c87422146f52eda6e697d53b0f8b8c1a1fcd2de8387c5d31295a46", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:6tjnjuyqrgmnfihpfdlww4m3/app.bsky.feed.post/3luo6xpqlis2r", "cid": "bafyreihp7yicadpp5gpj7njhstzulzozgpkuaawjamvcpxggtjuc5uydba", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "An image of a parody movie poster for \"Life of Chuck\" is on the right hand side of the image. Geordie's face has been placed over the top of Tom Hiddleston's. Big text on the poster reads \"Hands down the best fundraiser\". On the left hand side of the image text in comic sans reads \"i spent too long on this poster so i didn't have enough time to do a banner\" followed by the text \"plz come to my movie\"", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:6tjnjuyqrgmnfihpfdlww4m3/bafkreifbrb2dwggy7lmciogsxkmgl5lwz4kdherjcbzdare7okodlr6tpy", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6tjnjuyqrgmnfihpfdlww4m3/bafkreifbrb2dwggy7lmciogsxkmgl5lwz4kdherjcbzdare7okodlr6tpy"}], "original_created_at": "2025-07-23T23:40:20.242Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-07/3luo6xpqlis2r.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3luo6xpqlis2r", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz/post/3luo6qzn4gk2r", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:07+00:00", "content": "Thank you for the reminder I knew I missed something! Will delete and re-post!", "content_hash": "07e44bbc42192fbee10b87aca0426356e2af6fd6064192b428a93c40f3e19fab", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:6tjnjuyqrgmnfihpfdlww4m3/app.bsky.feed.post/3luo6qzn4gk2r", "cid": "bafyreic7ldimquhw7q4avvre2p3mx4wh2przh4go6p3rjq26t3rl3wmrb4", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-07-23T23:36:35.738Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-07/3luo6qzn4gk2r.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3luo6qzn4gk2r", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rebeccamatthews.bsky.social/post/3luixuq43l22x", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:07+00:00", "content": "Honestly What happens when we do try and cut costs “not like that”", "content_hash": "93a48af627c42f6f95fdacf11dc69dc3e5f8ce36bb8cdaddac57676280031fc9", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:nzmxipots5hdjhm7j3embfj2/app.bsky.feed.post/3luixuq43l22x", "cid": "bafyreia3ldltrnato2f3z5axnfueugiqifik24z7jtzdk3pgyah2xdyefm", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-07-21T21:50:05.060Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-07/3luixuq43l22x.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3luixuq43l22x", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz/post/3luhhxdzdts2y", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:07+00:00", "content": "Next term we have the opportunity to continue the fantastic work that @rebeccamatthews.bsky.social kickstarted. We can have a rating system that incentivises development, and gets behind housing for all, but to do that we need more Greens around the table www.thepost.co.nz/nz-news/3607...", "content_hash": "ef21fd838ced7ad1f6847966d30fd0be45924b9ff8b30301a08753ce1a79d61b", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:6tjnjuyqrgmnfihpfdlww4m3/app.bsky.feed.post/3luhhxdzdts2y", "cid": "bafyreibswvkiqn3w6qtdhecjzxxpm65z2uyuvq6qoqeh4xyfxkzwgzyo34", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-07-21T07:32:33.459Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-07/3luhhxdzdts2y.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3luhhxdzdts2y", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rebeccamatthews.bsky.social/post/3luhhhptp6k2g", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:07+00:00", "content": "Green councillors will push to get land value ratings across the line next term. Some other candidates continue to dress up their anti housing views in a flurry of “whataboutism” while rejecting every solution that will deliver more housing. Beware of the NIMBYism!", "content_hash": "156052702d6b6adeb41b2eb01f89ada31fc17119529ece67ff96723478607704", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:nzmxipots5hdjhm7j3embfj2/app.bsky.feed.post/3luhhhptp6k2g", "cid": "bafyreigyrktxytqwynii2cplazcna34zcwrd4d7ub2cylk2wis2ftowkwq", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-07-21T07:23:48.987Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-07/3luhhhptp6k2g.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3luhhhptp6k2g", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
